"penny":{"w":"penny","firstLevel":"初中","cn":"n. 便士， 分","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["便士","分"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈpeni/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈpɛni/","usSrc":"Wiktionary"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=penny&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"The trend, then, was toward the \"<B>penny</B> paper\"-a term referring to papers made widely available to the public.","cn":"","src":"2019·新课标Ⅲ卷·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2019年高考英语（新课标Ⅲ卷）· 阅读C","year":2019,"region":"新课标Ⅲ卷","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"But the phrase \"<B>penny</B> paper \" caught the public's fancy, and soon there would be papers that did indeed sell for only a penny.","cn":"","src":"2019·新课标Ⅲ卷·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2019年高考英语（新课标Ⅲ卷）· 阅读C","year":2019,"region":"新课标Ⅲ卷","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"Kwon and his research team have been working on building a small nuclear battery, presently the size and thickness of a <B>penny</B>, intended to power various micro/nanoelectromechanical systems.","cn":"","src":"2010·山东·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2010年高考英语（山东）· 阅读D","year":2010,"region":"山东","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"It didn't cost a <B>penny</B>.","cn":"那东西没花一分钱。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"penniless","ph":"/ˈpeniləs/","cn":"adj. 身无分文的，贫穷的"},{"w":"pennyworth","ph":"/ˈpeniwɜːrθ/","cn":"n. 少量；一便士的价钱"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["zk","gk","cet4","cet6","ky","ielts"],"collins":3,"oxford":1,"frq":0,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/3506e075bf4b6d88a935cc0857f702a0.png?","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["pen","ny"]},"flags":[]},
